er": "xoy", "content": "長期看的確會往QLC移動，不過控制晶片也會跟上", "time": "09/22 17:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "xoy", "content": "現在不在乎SLC TLC是效能早就沒差了，壽命會操爆的", "time": "09/22 17:43"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "xoy", "content": "人太少", "time": "09/22 17:43"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "eyecolor", "content": "https://i.meee.com.tw/bEQmdee.png", "time": "09/22 17:44"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "eyecolor", "content": "你是不是沒看仔細", "time": "09/22 17:45"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "xoy", "content": "所以他根本不知道這支的QLC效能，除非其他人都測錯", "time": "09/22 17:49"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "xoy", "content": "了", "time": "09/22 17:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "gtr0107", "content": "對HOMOLAB有印象 內容不錯", "time": "09/22 17:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "tcchu", "content": "厲害了", "time": "09/22 17:50"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "yoyo86215", "content": "在某S當BE FW RD笑而不語", "time": "09/22 17:52"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "manbow77", "content": "保底1MB/s如果是寫入大量kB小碎檔那算很厲害", "time": "09/22 17:54"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "manbow77", "content": "不少SSD快取用完後寫入kB碎檔容易掉到1MB/s以下", "time": "09/22 17:57"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "square4", "content": "緩內(pSLC)差不多，混合態(pTLC/QLC)比米板激進，", "time": "09/22 17:59"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "square4", "content": "表現離散可能不如SD卡，填充60%以上緩外(QLC)速度", "time": "09/22 17:59"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "square4", "content": "可能低到1MB/s https://i.meee.com.tw/szntYJg.png", "time": "09/22 17:59"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "square4", "content": "https://i.meee.com.tw/DV1ngyF.png", "time": "09/22 17:59"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "jhjhs33504", "content": "QLC的容量越大壽命越不是問題 蘋果檔案系統也有幫助", "time": "09/22 18:21"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "GLNB2RJ8", "content": "屎都不如的QLC 悲哀黑心蘋果", "time": "09/22 18:23"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "waterfall", "content": "哀鳳用QLC熱賣以後，安卓廠商就敢用了，不然誰用誰", "time": "09/22 18:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "waterfall", "content": "挨罵", "time": "09/22 18:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "waterfall", "content": "每次都是阿婆帶頭costdown，卓卓才敢跟進", "time": "09/22 18:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "bnn", "content": "太缺貨了 QLC你就吞了吧", "time": "09/22 18:33"}, {"tag": "推", "user"